          {"kind":"heading","id":"h","text":"Features","level":1},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t","text":"Everything WhatsApp does, on every platform, for free."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-2","text":"Messaging","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-2","text":"Text, photos, videos, documents up to 2GB, voice messages, locations and contacts. Messages can be edited within 15 minutes and deleted for everyone within two days. Disappearing messages can be set to 24 hours, 7 days or 90 days per chat."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-3","text":"Calls","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-3","text":"Voice and video calls with up to 32 participants, call links you can share, screen sharing on video calls, and picture-in-picture on mobile."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-4","text":"Groups and Communities","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-4","text":"Groups of up to 1,024 members with admin approval, polls and events. Communities bundle related groups with an announcement channel for up to 5,000 members."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-5","text":"Channels and Status","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-5","text":"Follow channels from organisations and people you care about; share status updates that disappear after 24 hours with the contacts you choose."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-6","text":"Meta AI","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-6","text":"Ask questions or generate images in a chat with Meta AI, or mention @Meta AI in a group. Your personal messages remain end-to-end encrypted; only messages sent to Meta AI are seen by it."},
