            "style": {"background":"#075e54","padding":14}
          },
          {"kind":"spacer","id":"gap-2","height":18},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h","text":"Security","level":1},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t","text":"Personal messages, calls, photos, videos, voice messages, documents and status updates are secured with end-to-end encryption by default. They are locked with a key that only the recipient has."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-2","text":"How it works","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-2","text":"WhatsApp uses the Signal protocol. Each message is encrypted with a unique key on the sender's device and decrypted only on the recipient's. Verify it in any chat: tap the contact name, Encryption, and compare the 60-digit security code or scan the QR code in person."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-3","text":"Protect your account","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-3","text":"Two-step verification: Settings, Account, Two-step verification. A six-digit PIN that is asked for when you register your number on a new phone."},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-4","text":"Passkeys: sign in with your face, fingerprint or device PIN instead of an SMS code."},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-5","text":"Never share your registration code with anyone. WhatsApp will never ask for it."},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-6","text":"Chat lock hides a chat behind your device biometrics; Silence Unknown Callers stops calls from numbers you do not know."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-4","text":"Encrypted backups","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-7","text":"Turn on end-to-end encrypted backup so your Google Drive or iCloud backup is protected with a password or a 64-digit key that only you hold."},
          {"kind":"link","id":"backup","text":"Back up and restore your chats","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help/backup-and-restore"},
          {"kind":"link","id":"block","text":"Block and report contacts","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help/blocked-contacts"},
          {"kind":"link","id":"wiki","text":"Signal protocol on Wikipedia","url":"http://en.wikipedia.org/"},
          {"kind":"spacer","id":"gap","height":24},
          {"kind":"divider","id":"rule"},
          {
            "kind": "row",
            "id": "footer",
            "children": [
              {"kind":"link","id":"foot","text":"Help Center","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help"},
              {"kind":"link","id":"foot-2","text":"Security","url":"http://whatsapp.com/security"},
