          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-2","text":"Quick answers","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-2","text":"Did not receive the verification code? Wait for the countdown, then choose \"Call me\". Make sure your phone has signal and that WhatsApp is not restricted by a battery-saver setting."},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-3","text":"Changed your number? Settings, Account, Change Number moves your account, groups and settings to the new number."},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-4","text":"Deleted a chat by accident? Restore from your latest backup by reinstalling WhatsApp; anything after the backup is lost."},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-5","text":"Want to leave a group quietly? Only the admins are notified when you leave."},
          {"kind":"link","id":"security","text":"Security features","url":"http://whatsapp.com/security"},
          {"kind":"link","id":"web","text":"WhatsApp Web","url":"http://whatsapp.com/web"},
          {"kind":"spacer","id":"gap","height":24},
          {"kind":"divider","id":"rule"},
          {
            "kind": "row",
            "id": "footer",
            "children": [
              {"kind":"link","id":"foot","text":"Help Center","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help"},
              {"kind":"link","id":"foot-2","text":"Security","url":"http://whatsapp.com/security"},
