            ],
            "gap": 18,
            "align": "center",
            "style": {"background":"#075e54","padding":14}
          },
          {"kind":"spacer","id":"gap-2","height":18},
          {"kind":"link","id":"crumb","text":"Help Center","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help"},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h","text":"How to back up and restore your chats","level":1},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t","text":"WhatsApp does not store your messages on its servers, so a backup is the only copy besides your phone."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-2","text":"Back up","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-2","text":"Android: Settings, Chats, Chat backup, then choose the Google account and the frequency (daily, weekly or monthly). iPhone: Settings, Chats, Chat Backup, Back Up Now, with iCloud Drive turned on."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-3","text":"Encrypt the backup","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-3","text":"In Chat Backup, turn on End-to-end encrypted backup and choose a password or let WhatsApp generate a 64-digit key. Keep it safe: without it the backup cannot be restored, not even by WhatsApp."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-4","text":"Restore","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-4","text":"Install WhatsApp on the new phone with the same number and the same Google or Apple account. When it finds the backup, tap Restore. Media may take longer than messages."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-5","text":"Moving between Android and iPhone","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-5","text":"Use Chat transfer: Settings, Chats, Transfer chats, and scan the QR code with the new phone while both are on the same Wi-Fi network. Both phones need the latest WhatsApp."},
          {"kind":"link","id":"security","text":"Security features","url":"http://whatsapp.com/security"},
          {"kind":"link","id":"next","text":"Next: block and unblock a contact","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help/blocked-contacts"},
          {"kind":"spacer","id":"gap","height":24},
