          {"kind":"link","id":"crumb","text":"Help Center","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help"},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h","text":"How to block and unblock a contact","level":1},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t","text":"Blocking stops messages, calls and status updates from a contact. They are not told they have been blocked."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-2","text":"Block","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-2","text":"Open the chat, tap the name at the top, scroll down and tap Block. Or go to Settings, Privacy, Blocked contacts, and add a contact. For a number you do not know, the first message includes a Block and Report option."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-3","text":"What a blocked contact sees","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-3","text":"Your last seen, online status, status updates and profile photo changes are hidden from them. Their messages never reach you and show a single tick on their side. They cannot call you."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-4","text":"Unblock","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-4","text":"Settings, Privacy, Blocked contacts, then swipe (iPhone) or long-press (Android) and Unblock. Messages sent while blocked are not delivered afterwards."},
          {"kind":"heading","id":"h-5","text":"Report","level":2},
          {"kind":"text","id":"t-5","text":"Report sends the last five messages from that contact to WhatsApp for review. Reporting spam and blocking at the same time also deletes the chat."},
          {"kind":"link","id":"help","text":"Help Center","url":"http://whatsapp.com/help"},
          {"kind":"link","id":"security","text":"Security","url":"http://whatsapp.com/security"},
